# ── The store (RevenueCat) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The public SDK key for each platform — Project settings → API keys, the `appl_…` and
# `goog_…` ones. Public by design: they identify the app to RevenueCat and can do nothing on
# their own. The server's `sk_…` secret key never comes near this file.
#
# A key starting with `test_` is RevenueCat's Test Store: the sheet opens, the whole flow
# runs end to end and no money moves — which is what a simulator or an emulator wants, since
# neither can reach a real store. Use the real key in anything that ships.
#
# Both are inlined by Metro at build time, so a change needs the bundler restarted with
# --clear. Set them on each EAS environment as well; with neither set the store is not
# configured and every call says so, while mock mode carries on with its canned store.
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_IOS_KEY=
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_ANDROID_KEY=
